{"id":"malachi","links":[{"id":"q711","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"romans","c":9,"v":13},"b":{"book":"malachi","c":1,"v":2},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Romans says “Jacob I loved”; Malachi says “Jacob I have loved,” in a line that also names Esau."},{"id":"q712","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"romans","c":9,"v":13},"b":{"book":"malachi","c":1,"v":3},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Romans says “Esau I hated”; Malachi says “Esau I have hated” and “I have made his mountains a wasteland.”"},{"id":"q713","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"matthew","c":11,"v":10},"b":{"book":"malachi","c":3,"v":1},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Matthew repeats Malachi’s words “Behold, I will send My messenger” and “who will prepare,” saying “before You” where Malachi says “before Me.”"},{"id":"q714","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"mark","c":1,"v":2},"b":{"book":"malachi","c":3,"v":1},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Mark and Malachi both have “Behold, I will send My messenger”; Mark says “ahead of You,” and Malachi says “before Me.”"},{"id":"q715","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"luke","c":1,"v":76},"b":{"book":"malachi","c":3,"v":1},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Luke says the child will go before the Lord to “prepare the way for Him”; Malachi has “who will prepare the way before Me.”"},{"id":"q716","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"luke","c":7,"v":27},"b":{"book":"malachi","c":3,"v":1},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Luke repeats Malachi’s words “Behold, I will send My messenger” and “who will prepare,” changing “before Me” to “before You.”"},{"id":"q717","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"l